title Search indexing pipeline
app[App] -> db[MySQL] : update product
db -> cdc[CDC Connector] : binlog
cdc -> kafka[Kafka] : product-changed
kafka -> indexer[Indexer] : consume
indexer -> es[Elasticsearch] : update document
user[User] -> search[Search API] : search
search -> es : query
es --> search : results
search --> user : 200
pin user 0,2
pin search 3,2
rank db cdc
